<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113363" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαρακτηρ-ιστικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>characteristic,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς Λυσίου λέξεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Lys.</u>
					11
				</span></i>
			 (
				Sup.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγου Δημοσθενικοῦ μηνύματα χ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Dem.</u>
					34
				</span></i>
			, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ἀγαθοῦ, τῆς ὕλης,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>P.</u>
				3.173
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				36
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ἁπλῶς βαρέος, κούφου,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Cael.</u>
				713.24
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ χ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.D.
					<u>Synt.</u>
					103.17
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Choerob.
				<u>in Theod.</u>
				2.31H.
			</span></i>
			Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eust.
					1167.59
				</span></i>
			.—The form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαρακτηρικός</span></b>  is found in <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Po.Herc.</u>
				1676.7
			</span></i>, in codd. of <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Dem.</u>
				39
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				51
			</span></i>, and is v.l. in Id.<u>Lys.</u>l.c.
				Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαρακτηρικῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					2.297S.
				</span></i>
			</div>
